# ClosureCapture VarAddr path: a function captures a variable from its enclosing dict.
# f is a zero-arg function; $outer is a free variable that the resolver converts to
# VarAddr::ClosureCapture(0). At call time eval_core.rs looks it up via frame.closure_env[0].
[outer: 42  f: [fn [let] $outer]  result: [f]]
---
%.result
=== out
Int(42)
